{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_f12yin_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_f12yin_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "意外的煩惱",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_f12yin_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1b5741855c7a848b15883689dd497372eb7ef8f9a0e04b0c13ff4c70f49e0165",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "山，有幾個賞金獵人往你那邊去了，數量不少！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "放心，這個數量，我一個人應付得來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "嘖，不知道哪裡來的一群麻煩人物，羅德島，我記住你們了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "很遺憾，你們到此為止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "別以為你塊頭大就能對付我們所有人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "弟兄們，一起上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "那批賞金獵人有點多，我們快去山那邊支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "嗯。不過也不用太擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "就這幫人的實力，我怕還不夠山打的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "啊？雖然我看他體格就覺得很能打，但是他平時又很有禮貌，就以為他不是那一型的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "你是第一次跟他一起出任務吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "我一開始也跟你想的一樣，覺得他說不定只是看上去強壯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "不過我馬上就意識到我錯了，這個新來的可不得了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "就是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "就是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "吼！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "先不說了，我們去他的背後方向吧，大概幫他抓幾個漏網的就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "怪......物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "和其他人相比，我不算什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "一個人對付這麼多人，要想全部解決果然還是有些托大了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "山，我們幫你把幾個逃跑的抓回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "非常感謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "哇，都被打得七零八落的，好慘......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "這棵樹都被折斷了，嘖嘖，我算是理解了為什麼說不用擔心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我還不太習慣團隊合作，抱歉，我應該中途就聯絡你們來協助我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "沒事沒事，你這不是幹得很漂亮嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "不能這麼說，任務的目標是解決賞金獵人給附近村莊帶來的困擾，如果有人逃跑了那就會留下隱患。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "如果不是有你們幫我善後，這次任務可能就失敗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "你這傢伙，真認真啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "難道不該這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "沒，是該這樣。就是好久沒見到你這麼認真的新人了，有點感慨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "比起這個，你沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "沒事，一些皮外傷而已，很快就會好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "我不是說你的傷，我是說你的衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "衣服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員A",
      "text": "山，你的禮服完全炸掉了，你現在跟裸體也差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "啊，呃，抱歉，讓你們見笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我戰鬥的時候總會忘記這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "哈哈，沒事。不過上次你也是這樣，真的不考慮換一身專門出任務的衣服嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員B",
      "text": "每次出任務都要壞一套衣服也太浪費了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我習慣於穿禮服了。不過你說得確實有道理，我會考慮的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "想要一套可以適應戰鬥的禮服......是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "是的，當然，如果認為這個要求不合理的話就不必了，我並不堅持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "嗯......首先，應該有人告訴過你，你的制服需要額外申請吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "是的。負責我的後勤告訴我，因為沒有適合我的體格的標準制服，所以如果我有需要，是要額外申請的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我當時沒有預料到成為幹員後要頻繁地戰鬥，於是一直沒有申請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "所以出了一陣子任務之後就陷入了衣服經常毀壞的狀況了嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "那你不是要準備好幾套禮服，挺貴的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "事實上，我第一個月的薪資幾乎全部用來購置禮服了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "誒，不是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我剛出......咳咳，我剛離開家鄉，羅德島配備的東西也很齊全，並沒有什麼特別需要購買的東西，所以並不構成什麼大問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "不過我想這樣下去也確實不是辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "其實你別穿禮服戰鬥就能解決呃......一半問題吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "確實如此。所以我剛才也說了，我對這件事並不堅持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "只是我個人比較喜歡禮服，而且我看到其他幹員的裝扮也相當自由，所以姑且想要詢問一下有沒有這樣的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "如果不行，那麼我申請一件耐用的戰鬥服裝就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "嗯......你這個請求確實比較少見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "因為雖然各位幹員的著裝都比較特殊，不過大多都是不影響他們行動的那種。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "既然如此，那就算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "哎，我還沒說完呢，我說很少見，但是沒說不行啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "反正你的制服也需要重新做，只是稍微多一些工而已，沒事的啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "啊，對了，正好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "梓蘭小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "幹什麼，我現在很忙，別找我喝下午茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "哎呀，不是啦，事情是這樣的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "拜託啦，梓蘭小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......我開始感覺頭疼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "別這麼說嘛，梓蘭小姐，你看，你不是天天抱怨後勤無聊嗎，這不比坐辦公室有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "被當成半個後勤已經夠累了好不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "有獎金哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "真的假的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "為大家排憂解難當然會有獎勵啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......雖然你差點說動了我，不過我最多只能算是設計師，不是裁縫，要做衣服的話找我是真的找錯人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "誒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "哈......算了，我恰好知道你該去找誰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你的代號是山是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "是的，女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "女士......就算了，我的代號是梓蘭。跟我來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "謝謝你啦，梓蘭小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "下午的蛋糕記得給我留一份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "text": "沒問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "梓蘭小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "從剛才二位的對話判斷，羅德島上有專門的裁縫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "不，我要帶你去找的人也是一名幹員，只是她同時也是一個裁縫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......這在這裡是被允許的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你指什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "從我這段時間的體驗來看，我以為羅德島是一個偏向安保公司性質的組織。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "在這樣的組織裡，我從未聽過可以允許兼職裁縫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......看來你確實是剛加入羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "此話怎講？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你對羅德島有相當大的誤解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "好吧，大概也不能算是誤解，我一開始也有一些和你差不多的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "願聞其詳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你這人說話感覺和月見夜在另一個方向上讓人不太爽......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "比起我來說，你大概等一下就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，是梓蘭小姐啊，午安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "嗯，中午好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "這位是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我是新加入的幹員，代號是山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，你好，我的代號是柏喙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你今天沒有任務嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "有，不過我在大約兩個小時後才出發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "請問，找我是有什麼事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "兩個小時應該來得及。是這樣的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，原來是山先生想要一套可以戰鬥用的禮服嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "如果麻煩的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "完全不麻煩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "倒不如說，請務必交給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "只需要將布料換成適合戰鬥的......不，不對，這樣可能會影響一些美感......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "柏喙，別站著說這些，先嘗試一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，是的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "抱歉，我還沒有做過這樣的嘗試，可能會需要一些時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "沒關係，只要能有成果，我也願意付出一些時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "那請跟我來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓蘭小姐要來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "我還有一堆文件要處理，還有蛋糕......不過姑且還是一起看一看版型吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "我也挺好奇能做出怎樣的衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "山先生是對於禮服有什麼執著嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "執著......談不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我從小就被父親要求穿這樣的衣服，久而久之也就習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，如果是一些難言之隱的話，不用說也沒關係的，我只是有些好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "不，並不是難言之隱，而是我自己也在想，我心中是否真的有這樣的念頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我曾出於一些原因被迫離開我的家庭相當一段時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "期間我的生活也比較......艱苦，並沒有穿禮服的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "當我獲得離開那裡來到羅德島的機會後，我第一時間為自己購置了一套禮服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我不知道這其中有沒有我在想念我的家庭，我的父母的原因在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "原來是這樣......你現在也見不到你的父母嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "是的。我來到羅德島也是期望未來能夠去見他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "在那段艱苦的時間裡，一開始，我十分想念我的父母。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "但是久而久之，我也漸漸習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "所以我自己也分不清我對於禮服的這一點想法究竟是慣性使然，還是一些我對自己的提醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "兩邊都有也不奇怪吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......說的也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "說起來，柏喙小姐是裁縫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，不是的，我只是工作之外喜歡做一些裁縫而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我來到羅德島也有一些時間了，不少幹員都知道我的興趣，有些就會來找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "梓蘭小姐剛才也提到自己是設計師？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "嗯。我以前在時尚雜誌做編輯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "羅德島的制服大部分都是量產的，不過這裡都是些有個性甚至個性過剩的傢伙，總會想要一些不一樣的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "這種時候，就是我和柏喙發揮的時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "唉，一開始我倒也挺樂意的，時間久了就覺得你們還是穿制服吧，一個兩個提的都是什麼稀奇古怪的要求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你這個要求，說實話已經算是我見過的比較正常的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但是為其他人製作服裝很開心啊，一些要求雖然奇怪，但是實現起來其實也是挺有意思的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "哎，你這孩子，說這話的人一般都會被累死，不要對別人太寬容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "可是，我覺得梓蘭小姐對A6的各位也很寬容......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梓蘭翻了個白眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "怎麼了，從剛才開始就一句話都不說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "不，只是二位的對話讓我一時間以為自己走在某條繁華的街道上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......我打算以後給你介紹一個叫月見夜的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "他也是幹員嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "沒錯，我很期待看你們兩個聊天會聊成什麼樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊，到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "這是......倉庫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "嗯，平時是作為倉庫使用的，只是同時也是我做裁縫的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "那麼，接下來，山先生，我要測量一下你的身體數據，請你配合我的行動好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "嗯嗯，這樣必要的數據就都收集好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "說起來，山先生你對禮服的設計有什麼偏好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "沒有，和我現在穿的類似就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "那麼顏色呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "白色吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我明白了，接下來就交給我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "等衣服完成了我會叫你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "這樣就可以了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "雖然沒有特殊要求，不過樣式果然還是重新做比較好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "對了，上個月設計的那一套或許改一改可以用！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你給我看過的那一套？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "那套本身沒有問題，但是給山穿有點太斯文了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "嗯......也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "而且設計也好製作也好都不急，重點還是在布料的選擇上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "這個我去幫你問問負責服裝的後勤吧，他們肯定知道哪種布料比較適合戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我和你一起去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "因為禮服本身就有天然的觀賞要素在，只是適合戰鬥的耐用布料我覺得可能會差一些感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "雖然也不是不可以，不過你要出任務了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊！糟了，我都要忘了這回事了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "抱歉，那可以等我回來後我們一起去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "嗯，你先去集合吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你也都聽到了，回去等著吧，如果後勤那邊買得到的話，大概過一周就能給你做好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "山先生，好了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "稍等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "感覺怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "很舒適。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "是我喜歡的樣式，並且布料也非常結實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "非常感謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "是我要感謝你才對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "其實我本來因為布料的問題糾結了很久，一直找不到能讓我滿意的材料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但是這個時候我想起來我父親以前製作他的工業裝備時用到的一些材料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我以前從來沒有想過用那些來設計服裝，但是因為這個契機，我嘗試了一下，結果意外的好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "對我來說，這也是一次拓寬視野的製作過程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "原來如此，這樣再好不過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "雖然我覺得作為一般的設計師確實用不著去考慮用工業材料的問題......不過在羅德島也確實不用考慮這樣的常識就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "那麼，我還有任務，就先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "要是覺得衣服哪裡有問題，請隨時來找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "你傻站著幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......沒什麼，只是看著二位讓我理解到，看來我還未曾真正明白自己已經獲得了自由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "非常感謝你，梓蘭小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "禮服的事不用謝，應該做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "不，禮服的事只是一方面，是你讓我明白了自己的一些問題所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......真希望這句話能從空爆或者月見夜的嘴裡聽到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "不，沒什麼。雖然我不知道你經歷了什麼，也不知道你來羅德島是為了什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "不過，以前有個輕浮的男公關對我說過一句話，用在你身上大概也不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "請指教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "他問我，你想在羅德島過怎樣的生活？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "衣服有關的事以後也可以來問我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "不過最好別來問我，我忙死了，去找柏喙那孩子吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山",
      "text": "那麼......或許我該重新思考一下，在羅德島上的生活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
